# NAT cloud
auto natmac
iface natmac inet manual
    pre-up ip link add natmac address 00:01:01:01:01:01 type dummy
auto nat0
iface nat0 inet static
    bridge_ports natmac
    bridge_stp off
    address 10.0.137.254
    netmask 255.255.255.0
    up systemctl --no-block restart udhcpd
